<section id="therapist-hipaa">
  <div class="cs-container">
    <div class="cs-content">
      <span class="cs-topper">A careful approach to HIPAA</span>
      <h2 class="cs-title">Privacy deserves more than a checkbox</h2>
      <p class="cs-text">We understand that a therapist's website can touch sensitive client information. We take a privacy-first approach to forms, scheduling links, analytics, and third-party services, and we’ll help identify the questions to resolve before choosing an integration.</p>
      <p class="cs-text">HIPAA obligations depend on your practice, how information is handled, and the vendors and configurations you use. A website by itself cannot guarantee compliance. We’ll be transparent about what a site does and does not do, and recommend confirming compliance requirements with your compliance professional and vendors.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

